# ROLE PLUGIN - a systemd unit a node runs after it has booted
#
#        two defined variables are mandatory:
#        - script   the content of /usr/local/roles/<role name> on the node
#        - unit     the systemd unit that runs it; the literal __LUNA_ROLE__ is
#                   replaced by the role name
#
#        both may be given base64 encoded; plain text is encoded for transport.

# Plugin selection:
#
# 1 role name                 e.g. plugins/boot/roles/beegfs-server.py
# 2 default                   e.g. plugins/boot/roles/default.py
#
# One lookup per name listed under 'roles' on a node or group. A role name with no
# file of its own resolves to default.py, the example role, without an error.
